      "source": [
        {
          "question": "q-33122",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Differentiate $f(t)+g(t)$ with respect to $t$, given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =\u27e83t-1,\\,6-t,\\,7t\u27e9 \\\\ g(t) & =\u27e8{t}^{2},\\,1-{t}^{2},\\,t\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14048749/state.json",
          "file_sha256": "8bbd5e23263f56ea3cb8eb23fb4fd8fd21705614156bb2dafbeec6a71b0d54ee"
        }
      ],
      "basis": 1708,
      "reason": "Observed MA content supersedes the stored value",
      "action": "replace",
      "transaction_receipt": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14048749/edb-import/commit.edn",
      "basis_after": 1709
    },
    {
      "question": "q-33122",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
      "old_sha256": "9804f4f5a2dbfb558c5a2c516fa0111d254eee8685ab19e9e7756df4abedef20",
      "new_sha256": "a96de9e7d9c2f6bfda884dfdd5ee6ba7e89338f522c10baeb99cbc78b33ee60c",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "q-33122",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "By the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(f(t)+g(t))^{\u2032}={f}^{\u2032}(t)+{g}^{\u2032}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(t) & =\u27e8\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3t-1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6-t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(7t)\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e83,\\,-1,\\,7\u27e9 \\\\ {g}^{\u2032}(t) & =\u27e8\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-{t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e82t,\\,-2t,\\,1\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f(t)+g(t))^{\u2032} & ={f}^{\u2032}(t)+{g}^{\u2032}(t) \\\\  & =\u27e83,\\,-1,\\,7\u27e9+\u27e82t,\\,-2t,\\,1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e82t+3,\\,-2t-1,\\,8\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14048749/state.json",
          "file_sha256": "8bbd5e23263f56ea3cb8eb23fb4fd8fd21705614156bb2dafbeec6a71b0d54ee"
        }
      ],
      "basis": 1708,
